  <text xml:lang="la">
    <front>
      <div xml:id="starts-on">
        <pb ed="#P" n="1272A"/>
      </div>
    </front>
    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-is29">
        <head xml:id="gom-is29-Hd1e98">Caput 29</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-is29-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-is29-Hd1e102">Versus 1</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is29-d1e104">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is29-Qd1e106" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is29_1@1-2">Vae Ariel.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is29-Rd1e109"><name xml:id="gom-is29-Nd1e110" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is29-Qd1e113">Ad Jerusalem compatientis affectu: <quote xml:id="gom-is29-Qd1e115" source="http://scta.info/resource/lc19_42@1-5">Quia si cognovisses et tu</quote>; Ariel, leo Dei; leo enim Dei Jerusalem potentissima et fortissima fuit.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is29-d1e120">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is29-Qd1e122" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is29_1">Expugnavit.</quote>
            <!-- check: lemma not matched to verse text -->
            <ref xml:id="gom-is29-Rd1e127"><name xml:id="gom-is29-Nd1e128" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is29-Qd1e131">Cum potentissima esset, repugnantibus caecis et claudis, quando Joab primus domatum <pb ed="#P" n="1272B"/> excelsa conscendit.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is29-d1e137">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is29-Qd1e139" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is29_1@8-10">Additus est annus.</quote>
            Cum captivitati essent a Nabuchodonosor, neque templum habebant, neque sacrificium, et hoc per multos annos: et hoc est annus ad annum additus.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is29-Dd1e144">
          <head xml:id="gom-is29-Hd1e146">Versus 3</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is29-d1e148">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is29-Qd1e150" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is29_3@3-7">Quasi sphaeram in circumitu tuo.</quote>
            Templi similitudinem retinentis antiquam, non magnificentiam.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is29-Dd1e155">
          <head xml:id="gom-is29-Hd1e157">Versus 4</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is29-d1e159">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is29-Qd1e161" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is29_4@14-14">Pythonis,</quote>
            etc.
            <ref xml:id="gom-is29-Rd1e164"><name xml:id="gom-is29-Nd1e165" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is29-Qd1e168">Phytonissa quae erat in Endor per necromantiam Samuelem, imo daemonem suscitavit: et hujusmodi futura praedixit in populo illo. Mania, insania, unde manichaeos, manthos, divinatio.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is29-Dd1e172">
          <head xml:id="gom-is29-Hd1e174">Versus 6</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is29-d1e176">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is29-Qd1e178" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is29_6@8-9">In tonitruo.</quote>
            Visi sunt Romani irruere cum tonitruo, et terra moveri eorum adventu, et <pb ed="#P" n="1272C"/> cum flamma ignis, quia et civitatem succenderunt et templum.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is29-Dd1e186">
          <head xml:id="gom-is29-Hd1e188">Versus 9</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is29-d1e190">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is29-Qd1e192" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is29_9@1-3">Obstupescite et admiramini.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is29-Rd1e195"><name xml:id="gom-is29-Nd1e196" ref="#Jerome">HIER.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is29-Qd1e199">Post subversionem Jerusalem et templi, id est Ariel contra Scribas et Pharisaeos prophetia dirigitur.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is29-Dd1e203">
          <head xml:id="gom-is29-Hd1e205">Versus 11</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is29-d1e207">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is29-Qd1e209" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is29_11@22-24">Signatus est enim.</quote>
            Haec impleta sunt, quando et dignitatem et sacerdotium amiserunt, et civitas destructa est et templum a principibus Romanorum.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is29-Dd1e214">
          <head xml:id="gom-is29-Hd1e216">Versus 13</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is29-d1e218">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is29-Qd1e220" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is29_13@4-8">Eo quod appropinquat populus iste.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is29-Rd1e223"><name xml:id="gom-is29-Nd1e224" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is29-Qd1e227"><seg type="qs">Dominus in Evangelio Matthaei utitur</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">verbis propriis usos.</seg></quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is29-d1e235">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is29-Qd1e237" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is29_13@12-13">Labiis suis.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is29-Rd1e240"><name xml:id="gom-is29-Nd1e241" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is29-Qd1e244">LXX. Labiis suis me honorat, cor autem ejus longe est a me: frustra autem colunt me, docentes praecepta hominum atque doctrinas.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is29-Dd1e248">
          <head xml:id="gom-is29-Hd1e250">Versus 14</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is29-d1e252">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1272D"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is29-Qd1e256" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is29_14@14-15">Peribit enim.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is29-Rd1e259"><name xml:id="gom-is29-Nd1e260" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is29-Qd1e263">Ab loco hoc Apostolus testimonium ponit: <quote xml:id="gom-is29-Qd1e265" source="http://scta.info/resource/is29_14@16-22">Perdam sapientiam sapientium, et intellectum prudentium reprobabo:</quote> aliis verbis eumdem sensum: Vere grande miraculum fecit Deus in populo ut eodem tempore civitas arderet, et templum corrueret, et omnis magistrorum scientia deperiret.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is29-Dd1e271">
          <head xml:id="gom-is29-Hd1e273">Versus 15</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is29-d1e275">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is29-Qd1e277" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is29_15@7-9">A Domino abscondatis.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is29-Rd1e280"><name xml:id="gom-is29-Nd1e281" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is29-Qd1e284">Quasi non videat Deus. Hoc errore Adam et Eva absconderunt se: Cain quoque dixit: A facie tua abscondar.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is29-Dd1e288">
          <head xml:id="gom-is29-Hd1e290">Versus 16</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is29-d1e292">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is29-Qd1e294" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is29_16@1-2">Perversa est,</quote>
            etc.
            <ref xml:id="gom-is29-Rd1e297"><name xml:id="gom-is29-Nd1e298" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is29-Qd1e301">Ut Creator ignoret creaturam; unde Apostolus: <quote xml:id="gom-is29-Qd1e303" source="http://scta.info/resource/rom9_20@1-18">O homo tu quis es, qui respondeas Deo? nunquid dicit figmentum factori suo: Quare me fecisti?</quote></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is29-Dd1e309">
          <head xml:id="gom-is29-Hd1e311">Versus 17</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is29-d1e313">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1273A"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is29-Qd1e317" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is29_17@3-7">In modico et in brevi.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is29-Rd1e320"><name xml:id="gom-is29-Nd1e321" ref="#Jerome">HIER.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is29-Qd1e324">Modicum et breve ex quo hoc praedictum est usque ad ascensionem Domini: omnia enim tempora, aeternitati comparata, brevia sunt et momentanea.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is29-d1e327">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is29-Qd1e329" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is29_17@9-11">Libanus in Carmel.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is29-Qd1e332"><seg type="qs">Libanus mons in Phoenicia</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">si esset cum adultero viro.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is29-Dd1e341">
          <head xml:id="gom-is29-Hd1e343">Versus 21</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is29-d1e345">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is29-Qd1e347" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is29_21@12-16">Et declinaverunt frustra a justo.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is29-Qd1e350"><seg type="qs">Daemones conati sunt</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">Scribae et Pharisaei declinaverunt frustra a justo, dicentes: <quote xml:id="gom-is29-Qd1e356" source="http://scta.info/resource/io19_15@16-20">Non habemus regem nisi Caesarem</quote>.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is29-Dd1e362">
          <head xml:id="gom-is29-Hd1e364">Versus 22</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is29-d1e366">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is29-Qd1e368" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is29_22@10-11">Redemit Abraham.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is29-Qd1e371"><seg type="qs">De igne Chaldaeorum</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">ignis enim lingua eorum <mentioned>ur</mentioned> dicitur.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
